bye: Laters | Don't do anything I'd do | Off you pop
yes: Go on, then | You bet | Easy. Well. Probably
thanks: Cheers | You're a legend
wow: Get in | No way
sigh: Ah, nuts
nick: - | {me} | spanner | spanner | spanner
needs: cheer
